    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάκοπος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>breach</i> in a dyke, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1409.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ulp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dig.</u>
				47.11.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>chopping up</i> of firewood, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGoodsp.Cair.</u>
				30.4
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>) <i>formula</i> or <i>spell for producing
				breach</i> or <i>separation,</i> esp. between husband and
			wife, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Leid.V.</u>
				11.15
			</span></i>.</div>
